      "userRequest": "Tell the story of Rapunzel as an animated storybook: a title Koma with the tower at dusk, the hidden girl with the golden hair in the tower, \"Rapunzel, Rapunzel, let down your hair\" with the braid growing to the ground, the prince who hears her singing and climbs up, the turning point when Gothel cuts the braid, the long search through the wild forest, and a joyful ending at dawn with lanterns rising.",
